{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing with this VR application, you can learn the techniques of Kendama, a traditional Japanese toy. There are two types of techniques that can be learned: \u201cMoshikame\u201d and \u201cTsubame-gaeshi\u201d. If you practice these techniques in the app, you will be able to do them in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the VR world, you practice in an environment where the ball moves slowly and then gradually becomes faster. The system supports smooth progress with fewer stumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please practice Kendama while following the model moves that appear in front of you, and then try actual Kendama in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Warning\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This app is only compatible with Quest.</strong><br><strong>Please note that other devices may cause hand orientation or malfunction.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814630?t=1759885916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3814630?t=1759885916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814630/58b74d7352bd9c2e3eb1652c11a58f96cc196afe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759885916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814630/58b74d7352bd9c2e3eb1652c11a58f96cc196afe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759885916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing with this VR application, you can learn the techniques of Kendama, a traditional Japanese toy. There are two types of techniques that can be learned: \u201cMoshikame\u201d and \u201cTsubame-gaeshi\u201d. If you practice these techniques in the app, you will be able to do them in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the VR world, you practice in an environment where the ball moves slowly and then gradually becomes faster. The system supports smooth progress with fewer stumbles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please practice Kendama while following the model moves that appear in front of you, and then try actual Kendama in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Warning\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This app is only compatible with Quest.</strong><br><strong>Please note that other devices may cause hand orientation or malfunction.</strong></p>","developers":["Ima Create Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814630/8d73f971c0e62fee64c42bf2c2b7f25ff44e614d/header.jpg?t=1759885916","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814630/541997125/fb9d9a772a45a4d52936dbe91b7729047b6ec9a1/1750365683/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758600646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814630/541997125/fb9d9a772a45a4d52936dbe91b7729047b6ec9a1/1750365683/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758600646","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3814630/541997125/fb9d9a772a45a4d52936dbe91b7729047b6ec9a1/1750365683/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758600646","id":257156941,"name":"\u3051\u3093\u7389\u3067\u304d\u305f\uff01VR","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156941/ece20441b2bfde83888f65259fd05d7badd1816e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758600646"}],"name":"CanKendama","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li